{"id":"lele-5","title":"202206 青少年软件编程等级考试Scratch一级真题","subject":"scratch","subjectName":"电子学会Scratch","level":1,"yearmonth":"202206","year":"2022","count":37,"questions":[{"no":1,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"广场中有声控喷泉，当声音的音量大于60的时候，喷泉就会喷出水，现在的音量为30，下列哪个选项可以让喷泉喷出水？"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648485414144.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648485853996.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648486135655.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648486247236.png"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"当前声音的音量为30，需要将声音增加到60以上就可以让喷泉喷出水，选项A将声音减少40，选项B将声音增加40，选项C设置音量为40，选项D将音调增加40，故选项B正确。","auto":true},{"no":2,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"造型编辑器中，选中橙子以及它的阴影后，点击下面哪个按钮可以让造型从图1变成图2？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648500702524.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648500959291.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648501345224.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648501438880.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648501545047.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648501635849.png"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"考察造型中的垂直翻转","auto":true},{"no":3,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"小猫和小狗赛跑比赛，下图的黑线是终点，两个角色初始位置距离终点都是50步，点击绿旗后，谁先到达终点？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648517227956.png"},{"t":"下图为小猫的程序："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648518686888.png"},{"t":"下图为小狗的程序："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648518907469.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：小猫"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：小狗"},{"t":"C：同时到达"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：不一定"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"积木“播放声音等待播完”是指声音播放完毕后才往下继续执行，显然要耗时更长。","auto":true},{"no":4,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"下面选项说法错误的是？"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：舞台区可以同时展示多个角色，但是只能同时展示一个背景。"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：角色的造型有位图和矢量图两种模式。"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：作品名称只能在编程界面修改，不能在保存到电脑时修改。"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：不使用积木块也可以设置角色的旋转方式。"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"作品名称可以在编程界面修改，也可以在保存到电脑时修改。","auto":true},{"no":5,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"小猫有如下两个造型，下列程序执行结束后，小猫的造型是？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648523068387.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648523237261.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：造型1"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：造型2"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：有可能造型1，也有可能造型2"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：造型1和造型2会不停切换"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"程序按照从上往下的顺序执行，先是换成造型2，等待一秒之后切换为下一个造型，因为小猫只有两个造型，造型2的下一个造型是造型1。","auto":true},{"no":6,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"绘制完风车的图案后，不小心画错了，多画了一条黑色的线。下列哪个选项能够让风车立刻变回原来的样子？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648528411530.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648528732074.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648528945447.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648529283936.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648529424542.png"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"A是橡皮，使用橡皮会擦掉风车的叶片；B是撤销上一步操作，可以用来撤销上一步操作；C是画笔用来画图案的；D是恢复下一步操作。题目要求立刻恢复回原来的样子，因此点击撤销按钮，即可恢复到上一步操作前。","auto":true},{"no":7,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"Ben角色的造型列表如下图所示，下列选项中，造型名称和造型编号对应正确的是？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648532451237.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：造型名称ben-a对应造型编号0"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：造型名称ben-b对应造型编号2"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：造型名称ben-c对应造型编号1"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：造型名称ben-d对应造型编号3"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"造型名称ben-a对应造型编号1；造型名称ben-b对应造型编号2； 造型名称ben-c对应造型编号3；造型名称ben-d对应造型编号4。","auto":true},{"no":8,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"舞台的两个背景如下图所示，小猫每天先去篮球场打球3分钟，再去游泳池游泳。下面哪个选项能正确表示运动场景变化？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648536748915.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648536999017.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648537181479.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648537368816.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648537513353.png"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"先去篮球场打球，所以需要先将背景设为篮球场，打球时间为3分钟，所以需要加上等待180秒，最后去泳池游泳，需要再将背景设为游泳池。","auto":true},{"no":9,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"Parrot有两个造型，下列选项程序执行结束后，能够看到Parrot多次挥舞翅膀效果的是？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648539292249.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648539588990.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648539758207.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648539943064.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648540114282.png"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"想要看到Parrot多次挥舞翅膀，需要满足两个条件，一是多次切换造型，二是加上等待积木块看清楚变换造型的过程。","auto":true},{"no":10,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"舞台有如下背景，程序执行结束后，舞台最终显示的背景是？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648543619348.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648543785877.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：Arctic"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：Desert"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：Farm"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：Urban"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"程序是按照从上到下的顺序执行的，先是换成Urban背景，再换成Desert背景，最后换成下一个背景，也就是Farm背景。","auto":true},{"no":11,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"Casey的造型列表和舞台的背景列表如下图所示。当程序执行结束后，正确显示舞台区的背景和角色造型的是哪一个选项？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648546008554.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648546217470.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648546541350.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648547143376.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648547603614.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648547784974.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648547943704.png"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":12,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"有如下两根木棒，在不叠放的情况下切成五段圆柱，需要切几次？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648552584197.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648552584197.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：1次"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：2次"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：3次"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：4次"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"已经有了两段木棒，切一次得到三段，切2次得到四段，切3次得到五段，答案是C选项。","auto":true},{"no":13,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"观察下列图形规律，虚线框中应该填入的图形是？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648554956603.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648555149710.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648555329453.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648555541872.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648555999994.png"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"方框中的四个图形按照顺时针方向移动，每次移动一下，从第三个方框中的图形可推断出虚线框中的图形，答案是C选项。","auto":true},{"no":14,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"两个队伍进行一对一竞赛，队伍一有3个人，队伍二有3个人，要保证每个队员都和对方的三名队员比过一场，应该安排几场比赛？"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：6场"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：7场"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：8场"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：9场"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"队伍一的1号队员和队伍二的三名队员比三场，2号队员和队伍二的三名队员比三场，3号队员和队伍二的三名队员比三场，一共是9场比赛，答案是D选项。","auto":true},{"no":15,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"小玉、小林、小明和小红四人在比谁的铅笔多，小玉说我的笔比小林多，小明说小红的笔比小林少，小红说小明的笔比我少，请问四人谁的铅笔最多？"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：小玉"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：小林"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：小明"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：小红"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"根据“小玉说我的笔比小林多”，可得出笔的数量上小玉>小林；根据“小红的笔比小林少”，可得出笔的数量上小林>小红；根据“小红说小明的笔比我少”，可得出笔的数量上小红>小明。可得出四个人在笔的数量上的关系是：小玉>小林>小红>小明，所以笔最多的是小玉，答案是A选项。","auto":true},{"no":16,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"小甲虫的初始状态与位置如左图所示。下列选项中，能够让小甲虫爬上右图位置并且头朝上的是？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648562656377.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648562832706.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648563039043.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648563952169.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648564095842.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648564229273.png"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"甲虫的默认方向面向90，让甲虫面向0方向，设置旋转方式为任意旋转，甲虫的头在向上移动的时候朝着舞台上方，所以选择C选项。","auto":true},{"no":17,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"执行下面哪段程序，可以让苹果由图1的默认状态切换到图2的状态？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648565547637.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648565726118.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648565918648.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648566072243.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648566197755.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648566326209.png"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"观察图片1和图片2，两个苹果图片左右镜像，所以是“将旋转方式设为左右翻转”积木块，图片1是默认状态，因此图片1的面向方向为90，故图片2面向的方向为-90，所以选择D。","auto":true},{"no":18,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"角色默认的样式与方向如图1所示，执行图2的程序后，箭头指向的方向为？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648568929011.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648569066886.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：上"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：下"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：左"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：右"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"箭头默认的方向为：面向90方向，它的旋转方式为任意旋转，所以会根据实际的旋转方式旋转，3个右转30度，就会右转90度，右转90度后，箭头会面向下方，所以选择B。","auto":true},{"no":19,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"角色的当前音量如下图所示为70%，下面哪个选项能够让声音变小一点？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648571728009.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648571902276.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648572051032.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648572198092.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648572347098.png"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"A选项声音会消失，只有D选项会将声音变小一点。","auto":true},{"no":20,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"执行下列程序，能够听到几声猫叫？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648573999447.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：1"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：2"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：3"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：4"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"由于程序执行的速度很快，第1声猫和第2声猫叫重合，第3声猫和第4声猫叫重合，所以只能听见2声猫叫，选择B选项。","auto":true},{"no":21,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"Ballerina的初始造型为造型3，在小绿旗积木下需要拼接几块“下一个造型”指令积木，在运行程序后才能让Ballerina换成造型2呢？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648575768076.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648575884872.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：1块"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：2块"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：3块"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：4块"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"因为当前的造型是造型3，执行2次“下一个造型”指令积木后，回到造型1，再执行一次“下一个造型”指令积木，才能变成造型2。","auto":true},{"no":22,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"小猫的初始位置与程序如下图所示，程序执行结束后，小猫停留在哪个区域？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648579424457.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648579908015.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：1号区域"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：2号区域"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：3号区域"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：4号区域"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"运行程序，角色先向右移动100步，接着角色再向下移动100步，这时候角色来到了4号位置。","auto":true},{"no":23,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"舞台上有一个Balloon1角色，Balloon1角色的初始造型和程序如下图所示，点击Balloon1三次后，舞台上显示？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648582685077.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648583419951.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648583689165.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648584998863.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648585524933.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648585673832.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648585826825.png"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":null,"auto":true},{"no":24,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"舞台上有一只小猫如图1所示，小猫现在在最左边格子的中心，每走一格需要移动100步，程序如图2所示，要想让小猫走到红色格子的中心，需要点击几次小猫？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648604615190.png"},{"t":"图1"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648604889298.png"},{"t":"图2"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：3次"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：4次"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：5次"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：6次"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"通过阅读程序可知，每点击一次小猫，小猫运动50步，也就是半格。现在小猫到红色格子的中心需要移动三格，也就是300步。所以需要点击6次。","auto":true},{"no":25,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"在哪一个模块下能找到下面这块积木？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648607245959.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648607453677.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648607656985.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648607815750.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648607933641.png"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"当绿旗被点击积木属于事件积木，因此在事件模块下可以找到。","auto":true},{"no":1,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"只能通过积木块和拖动角色的方式改变角色的坐标。"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"还可以在角色区改变角色的坐标。","auto":true},{"no":2,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"舞台背景列表如下图所示，想要从背景1切换为Woods背景，使用“下一个背景”积木块和“换成Woods背景”积木块都可以实现。"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648610414098.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"背景1的下一个背景是Woods背景，所以使用“下一个背景”积木块和“换成Woods背景”积木块都可以实现。","auto":true},{"no":3,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"Bear的造型列表如下图所示，使用“下一个造型”积木块，可以让Bear的造型变为bear-a。"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648611541864.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"Bear的初始造型是bear-b，下一个造型是bear-a。","auto":true},{"no":4,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"母鸡有下列两个造型，执行下列程序后，母鸡的头朝着右边。"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648612718683.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648612866453.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"角色的旋转方式不影响造型切换。","auto":true},{"no":5,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"每上一层楼需要走10阶楼梯，李华从1楼走到4楼一共走了40阶楼梯。"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"到1楼不需要走楼梯，1楼到4楼中间一共是3层，一共走了30阶楼梯，所以答案为错误。","auto":true},{"no":6,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"对于默认的小猫角色，将旋转方式设为不可旋转，小猫面向-90，小猫会倒立。"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"设置成不可旋转时，小猫一直朝向右，不会出现倒立。","auto":true},{"no":7,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"角色1的面向方向与旋转方式可以编程用积木修改，也可以在下面区域修改。"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648615923038.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"可以在角色区中修改面向方向与旋转方式。","auto":true},{"no":8,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"小鸡的造型列表与程序如图所示，运行程序后，可以清楚地看见小鸡一边向左移动一边切换造型。"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648617502942.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648617671467.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"没有加等待积木，不能看见程序中间运行过程，所以错误。","auto":true},{"no":9,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"在背景中用“将音量设为···”积木块调整音量，角色中的声音音量也会跟着变化。"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"每个角色与背景的音量都需要各自调节，所以错误。","auto":true},{"no":10,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"只能给角色添加一个声音。"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"可以添加多个声音。","auto":true},{"no":1,"type":"问答题","stem":[{"t":"旅行相册"},{"t":"1.准备工作"},{"t":"（1）删除小猫角色；"},{"t":"（2）选择角色Wizard-toad;"},{"t":"（3）删除默认白色背景，选择背景依次为：Forest，Boardwalk，Water And Rocks，Arctic；"},{"t":"（4）为背景选择声音Chill。"},{"t":"2.功能实现"},{"t":"（1）点击绿旗开始，角色Wizard-toad初始位置如图所示，初始造型为wizard-toad-a；"},{"t":"（2）程序开始1秒后，角色Wizard-toad向上跳起100步，换成wizard-toad-b造型，在空中停留1秒后，落到地面，换成wizard-toad-a造型，注意角色Wizard-toad始终朝向右;"},{"t":"（3）点击绿旗后，初始背景为Forest, 背景播放着声音Chill，同时每隔1秒切换一次背景，最后停在第四个背景Arctic。"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648621558692.png"}],"options":[],"answer":null,"analysis":"评分标准： （1）删除小猫角色和默认白色背景；（1分） （2）按照要求添加背景和角色；（2分） （3）角色初始造型、位置及背景设置正确；（2分） （4）角色能够跳起，并且能切换造型；（2分） （5）角色跳起和落下的过程中，始终朝向右边；（2分） （6）背景能够播放音乐；（2分） （7）能够切换四次背景；（2分） （8）播放声音的同时切换背景。（2分）","auto":false},{"no":2,"type":"问答题","stem":[{"t":"报时的公鸡"},{"t":"故事背景：公鸡在黎明时分会打鸣迎接太阳升起，古人也将鸡鸣声当做晨起的“闹钟”。"},{"t":"1.准备工作"},{"t":"（1） 背景：根据下图绘制两张背景；"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648625621074.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648625798489.png"},{"t":"（2） 删除默认角色，添加角色Rooster。"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648626229045.png"},{"t":"2.功能实现"},{"t":"（1） 点击小绿旗，角色Rooster初始化位置、大小，位于舞台左侧，面向右侧，造型为“rooster-a”，背景为“背景1”；"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648626717641.png"},{"t":"（2） 点击角色Rooster，Rooster从舞台左侧走到右侧，再从右侧走到中间；（注意走的过程中脚不能朝上，并且朝哪个方向走Rooster就面朝哪里）"},{"t":"（3） 走完后，切换成造型“rooster-b”，播放声音“rooster”，声音播完后，切换背景为“背景2”。"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648627244641.png"}],"options":[],"answer":null,"analysis":"评分标准： （1）能够添加角色Rooster，正确绘制出两张背景，两张背景能分别表示黑夜和白天；（5分） （2）能够正确设置角色Rooster的初始位置、大小、方向；（2分） （3）能够使用“当角色被点击”、“将旋转方式设为左右翻转”、“面向...方向”，实现角色Rooster被点击时，先向右走到舞台右侧，再向左走到舞台中间；（3分） （4）能够使用“换成...造型”实现角色Rooster的造型初始化和造型切换，使用“换成...背景”实现背景初始化和背景切换；（3分） （5）能够使用“播放声音...等待播完”，在角色Rooster切换造型后播放“rooster”。（2分）","auto":false}],"durationMin":60,"totalScore":100,"passScore":60,"source":"leledati","tags":{"year":"2022","type":"真题","progress":"未开始"}}